WEBVTT

00:00:09.376 --> 00:00:12.641
I'm not so fundamentally enthusiastic

00:00:13.413 --> 00:00:16.382
Even I will participate in this

00:00:17.017 --> 00:00:20.153
It's been a long time since we went for a drive

00:00:20.153 --> 00:00:22.417
Everyone is excited

00:00:22.989 --> 00:00:25.287
He's coming too

00:00:25.625 --> 00:00:28.822
I may have no chance with him right now

00:00:29.696 --> 00:00:32.563
But I'm definitely going

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:38.603
If you've got a good poker face

00:00:39.372 --> 00:00:41.741
There will be something

00:00:41.741 --> 00:00:45.812
Let's head to the mountains

00:00:45.812 --> 00:00:48.781
We'll just get sunburned at the sea

00:00:49.916 --> 00:00:53.920
Even though it's coat season

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:58.357
He is completely misunderstanding

00:00:58.625 --> 00:01:02.595
What's going on?

00:01:02.595 --> 00:01:06.566
Being this happy

00:01:06.566 --> 00:01:14.439
I'm laughing so hard I might burst

00:01:14.808 --> 00:01:22.982
I get choked up when I see his back

00:01:22.982 --> 00:01:30.889
In the whirlpool of an endless smile

00:01:32.926 --> 00:01:34.894
Episode #11
Respective Thoughts

00:01:34.894 --> 00:01:36.563
Episode #11
Respective Thoughts
...in a word, that's how it happened.

00:01:36.563 --> 00:01:37.030
Episode #11
Respective Thoughts
I was the one who found him,

00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:38.827
I was the one who found him,

00:01:38.965 --> 00:01:40.767
regardless of his position at the company.

00:01:40.767 --> 00:01:41.768
Really?

00:01:41.768 --> 00:01:43.870
But after we got to know each other,

00:01:43.870 --> 00:01:45.472
I asked her out without even
thinking twice about it!

00:01:45.472 --> 00:01:46.639
That's not true!

00:01:46.639 --> 00:01:47.240
Huh?

00:01:47.240 --> 00:01:47.640
Emilio couldn't get up the nerve to say the words.
Huh?

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:50.302
Emilio couldn't get up the nerve to say the words.

00:01:50.577 --> 00:01:51.978
He should have just asked me out right away.

00:01:51.978 --> 00:01:53.445
Don't take what she says seriously.

00:01:53.947 --> 00:01:55.582
Your sister can be kind of mean
sometimes, can't she?

00:01:55.582 --> 00:01:56.916
She's always been like that.

00:01:56.916 --> 00:01:58.218
What are you talking about!?

00:01:58.218 --> 00:02:01.020
In the end, it was me who had to ask you
out on our first date, wasn't it?

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:04.757
Well I was about to ask you out when
you just happened to beat me to it.

00:02:04.757 --> 00:02:06.659
You see? It's always like this.

00:02:06.659 --> 00:02:09.822
But anyhow, after that he really owed me!

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:14.267
Just listening to this, you'd think
I was totally hopeless.

00:02:14.267 --> 00:02:15.598
That you are.

00:02:16.569 --> 00:02:18.196
So what do you think about this guy?

00:02:18.805 --> 00:02:21.774
Dad's always so hard on guys, don't you think?

00:02:21.774 --> 00:02:23.042
Do you think Dad will like him?

00:02:23.042 --> 00:02:26.012
Well...

00:02:26.012 --> 00:02:28.139
Is it all right if I just tell you later?

00:02:29.449 --> 00:02:32.714
I'm just joking! I'm sure our dad will like you!

00:02:34.053 --> 00:02:36.214
You two sisters, I tell you...

00:02:37.023 --> 00:02:38.858
But it might be better if you
keep quiet about the fact

00:02:38.858 --> 00:02:40.655
that my sister was the one who asked you out!

00:02:41.361 --> 00:02:42.828
You've got a point there!

00:02:45.465 --> 00:02:46.666
Thank you so much for dinner.

00:02:46.666 --> 00:02:48.759
Not at all, I had a great time.

00:02:48.968 --> 00:02:50.603
Next time, you should invite your boyfriend

00:02:50.603 --> 00:02:51.604
and we can go out for lunch or something.

00:02:51.604 --> 00:02:52.472
Yeah, that's unlikely.

00:02:52.472 --> 00:02:54.908
She might be a grade-A student,

00:02:54.908 --> 00:02:56.342
but she's flunking out in the boy department.

00:02:56.342 --> 00:02:56.910
Really?

00:02:56.910 --> 00:02:57.343
Hey, Sis!
Really?

00:02:57.343 --> 00:02:58.278
Hey, Sis!

00:02:58.278 --> 00:03:01.414
Well, have you ever introduced me
to a boyfriend of yours? Huh?!

00:03:01.414 --> 00:03:02.949
You! Are you drunk?

00:03:02.949 --> 00:03:05.577
Actually, you just haven't told her
that you have one yet, right?

00:03:06.085 --> 00:03:07.086
Well...

00:03:07.086 --> 00:03:09.789
Hey, would you happen to know anyone
you could introduce her to?

00:03:09.789 --> 00:03:11.154
Enough already!

00:03:11.457 --> 00:03:14.187
Well, next time, you'll have to
tell me what your type is.

00:03:19.766 --> 00:03:22.860
Today, we had two people who were tardy
and four who were absent.

00:03:23.269 --> 00:03:26.568
Really? Would you please register
that in the log for me?

00:03:27.006 --> 00:03:28.303
Yes.

00:03:30.710 --> 00:03:31.878
What is it?

00:03:31.878 --> 00:03:34.745
One of the tardy students was Kate.

00:03:36.282 --> 00:03:37.408
I see...

00:03:37.951 --> 00:03:41.721
Maybe we should suspend her from Grace?

00:03:41.721 --> 00:03:42.789
A suspension?

00:03:42.789 --> 00:03:45.959
If she behaves like that, it sets a bad
example for the other students.

00:03:45.959 --> 00:03:47.060
I don't think that's necessary.

00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:49.629
Why do you stick up for Kate so much?

00:03:49.629 --> 00:03:50.396
What is that supposed to mean?

00:03:50.396 --> 00:03:50.663
I think you know what that means.
What is that supposed to mean?

00:03:50.663 --> 00:03:51.595
I think you know what that means.

00:03:52.765 --> 00:03:55.359
We have a petition signed by the
members of Grace calling for

00:03:55.969 --> 00:03:58.733
Kate to be brought before a
disciplinary committee.

00:04:01.474 --> 00:04:02.909
Naw, that can't be.

00:04:02.909 --> 00:04:04.344
I saw it!

00:04:04.344 --> 00:04:05.645
You gotta be joshing.

00:04:05.645 --> 00:04:06.145
Really, it's true!

00:04:06.145 --> 00:04:06.813
That's a total lie!
Really, it's true!

00:04:06.813 --> 00:04:07.313
That's a total lie!

00:04:07.313 --> 00:04:08.181
Really!

00:04:08.181 --> 00:04:09.515
What do you mean "really"?!

00:04:09.515 --> 00:04:10.483
Fine, I'll show you then.

00:04:10.483 --> 00:04:11.217
Okay.

00:04:11.217 --> 00:04:11.618
We'll head there together next time.
Okay.

00:04:11.618 --> 00:04:12.619
We'll head there together next time.

00:04:12.619 --> 00:04:14.087
Yeah fine, let's go then.

00:04:14.087 --> 00:04:14.454
You gotta be kidding.

00:04:14.454 --> 00:04:16.149
Same here...
You gotta be kidding.

00:04:23.229 --> 00:04:27.996
Speaking of that, you just took off
from that party the other day.

00:04:28.468 --> 00:04:30.265
Well, yeah.

00:04:31.070 --> 00:04:32.697
Did you have something to do?

00:04:32.905 --> 00:04:36.363
No, I just didn't feel very good.

00:04:37.043 --> 00:04:37.610
Why do you ask?

00:04:37.610 --> 00:04:38.577
No reason.
Why do you ask?

00:04:39.479 --> 00:04:41.538
It's just, I could have taken you
home if you'd said something.

00:04:42.115 --> 00:04:44.515
Yeah, I guess you could've.

00:04:45.451 --> 00:04:48.011
But why are you asking about it now?

00:04:48.254 --> 00:04:49.255
Well...

00:04:49.255 --> 00:04:51.658
It's just, you seemed to be
having a good time and all.

00:04:51.658 --> 00:04:54.627
But we're a couple, right?

00:04:54.927 --> 00:04:56.296
Yeah...

00:04:56.296 --> 00:04:58.491
So, why'd you just up and leave
without saying anything?

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:02.402
I'm sorry.

00:05:02.402 --> 00:05:04.937
Did you go to meet someone after that?

00:05:04.937 --> 00:05:05.938
Huh?

00:05:05.938 --> 00:05:07.166
That night...

00:05:07.607 --> 00:05:10.599
What? I didn't meet anyone!

00:05:12.378 --> 00:05:13.845
Why would you ask that?

00:05:15.448 --> 00:05:16.449
You're lying.

00:05:16.449 --> 00:05:17.617
What?!

00:05:17.617 --> 00:05:20.153
Recently, you spend all your time
reading books and stuff.

00:05:20.153 --> 00:05:21.245
You enjoy that?

00:05:21.621 --> 00:05:22.789
Luke...

00:05:22.789 --> 00:05:24.424
There's some guy you want to like you,

00:05:24.424 --> 00:05:25.914
