intelligent for him, right?

00:05:26.359 --> 00:05:28.928
What do you mean?
What the hell are you talking about!?

00:05:28.928 --> 00:05:30.997
Oh, there you two are!

00:05:30.997 --> 00:05:32.832
You know what I'm talking about, don't you?

00:05:32.832 --> 00:05:35.735
No, I don't. What is it you want to say?

00:05:35.735 --> 00:05:36.703
Huh? What's up here?

00:05:36.703 --> 00:05:37.470
What going on?

00:05:37.470 --> 00:05:37.904
If you've got something you want to say, say it!
What going on?

00:05:37.904 --> 00:05:39.739
If you've got something you want to say, say it!

00:05:39.739 --> 00:05:40.473
If you've got something you want to say, say it!
Easy, Rachel...

00:05:40.473 --> 00:05:41.107
Easy, Rachel...

00:05:41.107 --> 00:05:41.574
Whoa, whoa, I don't know what's going on
between you two, but...

00:05:41.574 --> 00:05:43.142
I think you know damn well!
Whoa, whoa, I don't know what's going on
between you two, but...

00:05:43.142 --> 00:05:44.744
No, I don't!

00:05:44.744 --> 00:05:48.581
You! What I'm saying is you're into
that Nick, the English teacher!

00:05:48.581 --> 00:05:49.843
Huh?!

00:05:51.050 --> 00:05:53.211
No way! No way!

00:05:54.787 --> 00:05:55.621
What the hell are you talking about?!

00:05:55.621 --> 00:05:56.022
I was pretty surprised to find out that
old bastard was your type!
What the hell are you talking about?!

00:05:56.022 --> 00:05:58.124
I was pretty surprised to find out that
old bastard was your type!

00:05:58.124 --> 00:05:59.525
Where did you get the idea from?!

00:05:59.525 --> 00:06:03.052
So, did you kiss him?
Or maybe you slept with him?!

00:06:06.065 --> 00:06:07.233
What did you do that for?!

00:06:07.233 --> 00:06:08.935
Luke, this is completely ridiculous!

00:06:08.935 --> 00:06:10.002
What is?!

00:06:10.002 --> 00:06:11.404
This is totally ridiculous!

00:06:11.404 --> 00:06:12.105
I know!

00:06:12.105 --> 00:06:12.605
You better watch your damn mouth!
I know!

00:06:12.605 --> 00:06:14.073
You better watch your damn mouth!
C'mon, what's going on here?!

00:06:14.073 --> 00:06:15.775
Stop it! What happened?!

00:06:15.775 --> 00:06:17.009
Come on...
If anything's ridiculous, it's you!

00:06:17.009 --> 00:06:18.101
If anything's ridiculous, it's you!

00:06:23.282 --> 00:06:24.772
I'm so disappointed in you.

00:06:26.686 --> 00:06:27.812
Rachel...

00:06:29.756 --> 00:06:32.850
I don't even want to see your face anymore!

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:35.128
Rachel?!

00:06:35.128 --> 00:06:36.095
Rachel?!
Rachel?!

00:06:36.529 --> 00:06:38.197
Luke, what's gotten into you?

00:06:38.197 --> 00:06:39.232
That was totally unnecessary!

00:06:39.232 --> 00:06:40.600
What happened?

00:06:40.600 --> 00:06:41.634
Well, what can you do about it?

00:06:41.634 --> 00:06:42.931
Shut the hell up!

00:06:43.236 --> 00:06:44.430
Luke?

00:06:44.971 --> 00:06:46.632
All of you, just shut the hell up!

00:06:48.408 --> 00:06:49.342
What the...

00:06:49.342 --> 00:06:50.673
What's his problem?!

00:06:51.344 --> 00:06:52.612
What a jerk!

00:06:52.612 --> 00:06:54.239
Wow, what a mess...

00:06:58.918 --> 00:07:00.078
Rachel!

00:07:02.522 --> 00:07:03.648
Leave me alone!

00:07:05.324 --> 00:07:06.450
Rachel...

00:07:07.960 --> 00:07:09.429
Get lost!

00:07:09.429 --> 00:07:11.829
Rachel, I'm sorry.

00:07:14.400 --> 00:07:17.130
I... I'm sorry.

00:07:18.671 --> 00:07:20.339
You were so mean...

00:07:20.339 --> 00:07:21.931
I really was.

00:07:23.075 --> 00:07:24.644
I was all worked up and confused.

00:07:24.644 --> 00:07:26.874
I didn't even know what I was saying anymore.

00:07:27.947 --> 00:07:29.244
I'm sorry.

00:07:31.517 --> 00:07:32.984
I wasn't acting normal.

00:07:35.288 --> 00:07:36.619
It doesn't matter anymore.

00:07:42.495 --> 00:07:43.496
Kate...

00:07:43.496 --> 00:07:44.622
Yes?

00:07:45.031 --> 00:07:46.699
There is going to be

00:07:46.699 --> 00:07:48.496
a disciplinary committee hearing after school.

00:07:48.734 --> 00:07:49.802
Huh?

00:07:49.802 --> 00:07:52.635
It's being held to decide whether or not
you're to be suspended from Grace.

00:07:53.306 --> 00:07:55.141
There are people saying that your
conduct, recently,

00:07:55.141 --> 00:07:57.575
has been unbecoming for a member of Grace.

00:07:58.344 --> 00:07:59.834
Is that so?

00:08:00.279 --> 00:08:03.476
All of the other members of Grace think so too.

00:08:04.116 --> 00:08:05.105
I see...

00:08:05.685 --> 00:08:08.085
But not me.

00:08:08.788 --> 00:08:11.518
The ultimate decision is mine to make.

00:08:12.191 --> 00:08:13.192
If you just continue to...

00:08:13.192 --> 00:08:14.318
Paula!

00:08:15.027 --> 00:08:18.224
Thank you for everything you've done for me.

00:08:19.198 --> 00:08:20.222
Kate?

00:08:22.201 --> 00:08:25.137
I am resigning from Grace.

00:08:25.137 --> 00:08:26.372
What are you saying?

00:08:26.372 --> 00:08:29.967
It's understandable that all of
the others think that.

00:08:30.343 --> 00:08:34.714
Even I think I shouldn't be in Grace.

00:08:34.714 --> 00:08:36.282
What are you saying?!

00:08:36.282 --> 00:08:39.445
Do you even understand what resigning
from Grace would mean for you?!

00:08:39.719 --> 00:08:42.054
Recommendations for universities,
all your aspirations...

00:08:42.054 --> 00:08:43.612
All that will be ruined!

00:08:44.557 --> 00:08:48.261
Yes, but it's okay.

00:08:48.261 --> 00:08:49.529
No!

00:08:49.529 --> 00:08:51.156
I won't accept that!

00:08:51.531 --> 00:08:55.735
Even if it means decreasing your duties,
I want you to stay!

00:08:55.735 --> 00:08:57.032
Paula...

00:08:57.503 --> 00:09:00.301
Don't just up and quit on me.

00:09:01.340 --> 00:09:06.175
Please. If you have problems,
I'll take care of them for you.

00:09:07.246 --> 00:09:08.508
Please...

00:09:25.264 --> 00:09:27.733
After talking to my mom and
going through old letters,

00:09:27.733 --> 00:09:30.566
these are the people I turned up.

00:09:33.005 --> 00:09:34.563
There's quite a few of them.

00:09:36.075 --> 00:09:40.136
But maybe one of these people knows
where your dad is, right?

00:09:40.279 --> 00:09:43.146
Yeah, maybe, but who knows.

00:09:44.050 --> 00:09:46.352
As the majority of the votes are in favor,

00:09:46.352 --> 00:09:48.820
Kate's suspension is hereby approved.

00:09:49.455 --> 00:09:52.788
Kate, herself, has failed to be present at this
disciplinary committee hearing,

00:09:53.326 --> 00:09:54.816
but I assume you are in agreement, President.

00:09:56.128 --> 00:09:58.028
No, I am not.

00:09:58.764 --> 00:10:02.200
As stipulated in Article 33, Clause 2,
of the Student Council Charter,

00:10:02.535 --> 00:10:06.472
I hereby exercise my right as President
to veto your decision.

00:10:06.472 --> 00:10:08.140
Paula, why would you...

00:10:08.140 --> 00:10:09.575
Paula, what do you mean?!

00:10:09.575 --> 00:10:10.803
I mean just what I said.

00:10:11.143 --> 00:10:13.839
This disciplinary committee is dismissed.

00:10:16.115 --> 00:10:18.484
What the? This doesn't make any sense!

00:10:18.484 --> 00:10:20.145
Why would she do that?

00:10:21.287 --> 00:10:24.991
Basically, I want you to let the guys
handle back-of-the-house jobs.

00:10:24.991 --> 00:10:28.628
Boss! You got a call from the clinic!

00:10:28.628 --> 00:10:30.027
I'm on my way.

00:10:30.630 --> 00:10:34.930
All the girls wear those uniforms.
Do you think you can handle that?

00:10:43.376 --> 00:10:44.638
No can do...

00:10:45.444 --> 00:10:46.775
I think we can still make it.

00:10:46.979 --> 00:10:48.014
Make it to what?

00:10:48.014 --> 00:10:50.483
I was thinking we'd go check
out a museum, you game?

00:10:50.483 --> 00:10:51.484
Huh?

00:10:51.484 --> 00:10:53.819
I thought we should get into
some cultural stuff,

00:10:53.819 --> 00:10:55.454
