00:10:57.790 --> 00:10:59.725
I like you the way you are.

00:10:59.725 --> 00:11:01.127
You don't have to force yourself
to go to places like that.

00:11:01.127 --> 00:11:02.028
No, I want to go! Really!
You don't have to force yourself
to go to places like that.

00:11:02.028 --> 00:11:03.129
No, I want to go! Really!

00:11:03.129 --> 00:11:04.630
I'm not forcing myself to do anything.

00:11:04.630 --> 00:11:05.898
What is this, all of a sudden?

00:11:05.898 --> 00:11:07.133
What d'ya mean, "What is this"?

00:11:07.133 --> 00:11:10.762
Forget all that stuff about Nick.
Really, nothing happened.

00:11:11.971 --> 00:11:13.572
I don't want to talk about this anymore.

00:11:13.572 --> 00:11:16.809
This has nothing to do with that guy,
and I won't talk about that ever again.

00:11:16.809 --> 00:11:17.677
Then, why?

00:11:17.677 --> 00:11:18.077
I want to go.
Then, why?

00:11:18.077 --> 00:11:18.744
I want to go.

00:11:18.744 --> 00:11:20.346
You're weirding me out.

00:11:20.346 --> 00:11:22.337
You've never even been interested
in that kind of stuff before.

00:11:22.581 --> 00:11:24.183
