00:11:24.183 --> 00:11:25.451
It just doesn't seem like you.

00:11:25.451 --> 00:11:27.248
It's fine. We're going.

00:11:27.653 --> 00:11:29.917
Today's theme: "A Day of Culture"!

00:11:31.624 --> 00:11:32.955
You're not sick, are you?

00:11:33.793 --> 00:11:36.729
Last night, after that...

00:11:36.729 --> 00:11:39.031
I couldn't get much sleep.

00:11:39.031 --> 00:11:39.965
Really?

00:11:39.965 --> 00:11:40.499
Say...

00:11:40.499 --> 00:11:41.000
Well, time's up.
Say...

00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:42.297
Well, time's up.

00:11:48.574 --> 00:11:49.768
Herve!

00:11:50.276 --> 00:11:51.402
What?

00:11:52.611 --> 00:11:54.738
If you don't have anything to ask,
don't follow me.

00:11:55.181 --> 00:11:56.546
Why?

00:11:57.950 --> 00:12:00.186
Why are you so cold?

00:12:00.186 --> 00:12:01.454
Well...

00:12:01.454 --> 00:12:05.185
Do you hate me?

00:12:07.626 --> 00:12:08.888
I do.

00:12:19.171 --> 00:12:21.162
