00:12:34.954 --> 00:12:38.515
Ah, I've seen that face somewhere before.

00:12:39.091 --> 00:12:40.092
Hi there...

00:12:40.092 --> 00:12:43.262
Yeah, I knew you couldn't stay away
from my cooking forever.

00:12:43.262 --> 00:12:44.559
Oh, yes I could.

00:12:45.364 --> 00:12:48.492
So, I suppose you've had
tons of job offers, eh?

00:12:49.135 --> 00:12:51.637
I didn't come here to listen to your sarcasm.

00:12:51.637 --> 00:12:53.005
Where you going?

00:12:53.005 --> 00:12:54.774
I was just in the neighborhood,
so I thought I'd drop by.

00:12:54.774 --> 00:12:55.900
Claire!

00:12:57.443 --> 00:13:01.046
You're here 'cuz you can't find
a job anywhere else, right?

00:13:01.046 --> 00:13:02.515
Sure I can.

00:13:02.515 --> 00:13:05.384
I wonder? All they'd get in return

00:13:05.384 --> 00:13:07.784
is you coming late, leaving early,
or not showing up period.

00:13:08.654 --> 00:13:10.489
I put up with a lot of crap from you.

00:13:10.489 --> 00:13:12.582
I just had a little free time on my hands.

00:13:13.325 --> 00:13:15.350
There's plenty of stuff I can do.

00:13:15.761 --> 00:13:17.596
Yeah, if someone ever gives you
the chance to do it.

00:13:17.596 --> 00:13:18.697
God, you're pissing me off.

00:13:18.697 --> 00:13:19.698
Hey!

00:13:19.698 --> 00:13:20.699
Later!

00:13:20.699 --> 00:13:21.934
Since you've got talent though,

00:13:21.934 --> 00:13:25.267
I can cut you a little slack in terms of your
foul moods and crappy manners.

00:13:25.805 --> 00:13:26.931
Huh?

00:13:27.306 --> 00:13:29.141
Me, I don't get it.

00:13:29.141 --> 00:13:31.905
But those hard-as-rock,
well-done burgers you make...

00:13:32.378 --> 00:13:34.647
I can't make 'em like that if I try.

00:13:34.647 --> 00:13:36.239
More sarcasm?

00:13:36.482 --> 00:13:41.086
I'm saying, I'd maybe hire you back if
you'd just work a little harder.

00:13:41.086 --> 00:13:43.020
Huh? What are you getting at?

00:13:43.823 --> 00:13:48.021
I'm proud of what I do, and I can't
make what I don't understand.

00:13:48.828 --> 00:13:51.530
Normally, I'd ignore anyone who said
they want to eat your burgers,

00:13:51.530 --> 00:13:53.054
'cuz they obviously ain't no gourmet.

00:13:53.799 --> 00:13:55.699
But believe it or not,
a lot of them are regulars, so...

00:14:03.509 --> 00:14:05.238
I don't work cheap.

00:14:06.078 --> 00:14:08.478
You start working a little harder and
we'll see what we can do.

00:14:09.682 --> 00:14:11.250
What d'ya say?

00:14:11.250 --> 00:14:13.741
There are a lot of people out there
who want to work here.

00:14:14.153 --> 00:14:18.180
Liar! Don't be mad at me if more
people become my fans!

00:14:18.624 --> 00:14:22.025
When that happens, I guess
I'll ask you how to fry 'em.

00:14:26.031 --> 00:14:27.896
When do you want me to start?

00:14:31.203 --> 00:14:33.739
Isn't that it? That sign over there.

00:14:33.739 --> 00:14:34.797
Yeah!

00:14:38.844 --> 00:14:41.404
Doesn't look like there's anyone here either.

00:14:47.553 --> 00:14:48.821
Are you coming back today?

00:14:48.821 --> 00:14:51.290
Yeah, I'll call you if I'm going to be late.

00:14:51.290 --> 00:14:51.857
Okay.

00:14:51.857 --> 00:14:52.191
See you tonight.
Okay.

00:14:52.191 --> 00:14:53.089
See you tonight.

00:15:02.501 --> 00:15:03.627
Herve?

00:15:04.003 --> 00:15:05.368
It's been a while.

00:15:06.772 --> 00:15:10.868
Now I remember. He lived two houses
down from your place, right?

00:15:11.176 --> 00:15:13.112
Is that old guy is still there?

00:15:13.112 --> 00:15:16.172
No idea, I moved out of there a long time ago.

00:15:16.382 --> 00:15:19.351
Really? Well, I guess that's back when
we were going to university.

00:15:20.185 --> 00:15:21.345
Herve...

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:23.222
Why'd you come and find me all of a sudden?

00:15:23.222 --> 00:15:24.951
There must be something you want?

00:15:25.224 --> 00:15:26.851
Well, yeah...

00:15:27.226 --> 00:15:29.194
I'm actually still on the clock, so to speak.

00:15:29.561 --> 00:15:31.756
Ah, you are, aren't you?

00:15:32.031 --> 00:15:33.658
I'm sorry, but I'm kind of in a rush.

00:15:35.901 --> 00:15:37.536
Well to be honest,

00:15:37.536 --> 00:15:40.733
I thought there's something I should tell you,
since you don't seem to know.

00:15:41.006 --> 00:15:42.308
What?

00:15:42.308 --> 00:15:43.570
It's about your girlfriend.

00:15:44.543 --> 00:15:48.147
Emilio, this girl you're seeing...

00:15:48.147 --> 00:15:50.049
Emma? What about her?

00:15:50.049 --> 00:15:51.283
This isn't easy to say.

00:15:51.283 --> 00:15:52.307
Say it anyway!

00:15:53.419 --> 00:15:58.288
Her younger sister is actually our enemy.

00:15:59.625 --> 00:16:02.560
Her younger sister's part of Animus.

00:16:12.638 --> 00:16:14.572
That's the way it goes.

00:16:15.174 --> 00:16:18.109
Damn, the one day we decide to come, this...

00:16:19.078 --> 00:16:20.946
What a culture-filled day this
is turning out to be!

00:16:20.946 --> 00:16:22.504
It's not my fault!

00:16:23.182 --> 00:16:25.017
Today, we'll just go as far as to confirm
the location of the museum.

00:16:25.017 --> 00:16:26.418
What? You mean you plan to come back?

00:16:26.418 --> 00:16:27.886
Well as for today,

00:16:27.886 --> 00:16:29.911
in commemoration of our first step towards
greater cultural awareness...

00:16:30.255 --> 00:16:31.381
What?

00:16:32.024 --> 00:16:33.258
Okay, smile Rachel!

00:16:33.258 --> 00:16:34.760
C'mon, we look stupid!

00:16:34.760 --> 00:16:35.761
It's in commemoration!

00:16:35.761 --> 00:16:37.160
People are watching.

00:16:39.631 --> 00:16:41.326
Look at this...

00:16:49.274 --> 00:16:53.142
I'm sorry, but I'm really in love with Emma.

00:16:53.445 --> 00:16:56.380
It's not like I'm saying we should
do anything to her.

00:16:56.749 --> 00:17:00.549
Please don't do anything to her
sister, to Kate, either.

00:17:00.886 --> 00:17:03.555
To Kate? But she's the enemy.

00:17:03.555 --> 00:17:04.579
So?!

00:17:04.957 --> 00:17:07.084
Betrayal won't be tolerated.

00:17:07.493 --> 00:17:10.223
There is no guarantee that you won't manifest.

00:17:10.729 --> 00:17:13.562
You understand? She might try to kill you!

00:17:14.366 --> 00:17:16.435
You shouldn't be seeing that girl.

00:17:16.435 --> 00:17:17.636
What are you saying?

00:17:17.636 --> 00:17:19.001
We're running out of time.

00:17:19.304 --> 00:17:21.874
I want to exorcise this abominable
curse that resides in us

00:17:21.874 --> 00:17:23.842
as soon as possible.

00:17:24.076 --> 00:17:25.177
But what about her?

00:17:25.177 --> 00:17:29.705
Emilio! I'm sure that this is what the
entire family would ask of you.

00:17:31.850 --> 00:17:35.650
I'm sorry. I can't cooperate with you.

00:17:36.655 --> 00:17:40.489
There will be hell to pay if the line's
elders find out about this.

00:17:50.002 --> 00:17:52.095
Is this the place?

00:17:53.839 --> 00:17:55.238
What's up girls?

00:17:55.641 --> 00:17:56.675
Um, we...

00:17:56.675 --> 00:17:58.609
Why don't you two come up here?

00:17:59.311 --> 00:18:01.142
Rose, let's get out of here!

00:18:01.947 --> 00:18:03.710
This sucks!

00:18:11.223 --> 00:18:13.191
You know, I feel a little more at ease today.

00:18:13.792 --> 00:18:14.860
Why's that?

00:18:14.860 --> 00:18:18.023
Well, it's been a long time since the two
of us spent a day together like this.

00:18:18.730 --> 00:18:20.425
Yeah, you're right.

00:18:21.066 --> 00:18:23.569
Before, I was actually thinking that,
the way things were going,

00:18:23.569 --> 00:18:24.603
our relationship might fall apart.

00:18:24.603 --> 00:18:25.570
Really?

00:18:26.638 --> 00:18:28.663
Maybe I was just worrying too much.

00:18:33.045 --> 00:18:36.947
I was down 'cuz I had this feeling
that you were avoiding me.

00:18:37.449 --> 00:18:40.646
No, I wasn't doing anything like that.

00:18:42.187 --> 00:18:44.456
I'm going to go grab a drink.

00:18:44.456 --> 00:18:47.084
Nothing's changed between us, has it?

00:18:51.530 --> 00:18:52.656
Rachel...

00:18:53.665 --> 00:18:54.632
What's wrong?

00:18:54.800 --> 00:18:56.001
I'm sorry...

00:18:56.001 --> 00:18:56.602
You don't want me to touch you?

00:18:56.602 --> 00:18:57.035
It's not that. It's not that, but...
You don't want me to touch you?

00:18:57.035 --> 00:18:59.435
It's not that. It's not that, but...

00:19:00.572 --> 00:19:02.472
I'm sorry, Luke.

00:19:02.808 --> 00:19:04.139
Don't apologize!

00:19:04.710 --> 00:19:06.371
What do you have to apologize about?

00:19:07.846 --> 00:19:09.279
What's going on?

00:19:09.948 --> 00:19:11.142
I'm sorry.

00:19:11.850 --> 00:19:13.652
I have to go.

00:19:13.652 --> 00:19:14.619
Where?

00:19:15.787 --> 00:19:19.416
Rachel, what is going on with you?!

00:19:20.526 --> 00:19:21.660
I'm sorry.

00:19:21.660 --> 00:19:22.820
Rachel!

00:19:24.863 --> 00:19:26.592
What in the hell is going on?

00:19:27.232 --> 00:19:28.392
Luke...

00:19:28.901 --> 00:19:32.428
Amanda, you're here?

00:19:33.405 --> 00:19:34.372
Yeah...

00:19:41.079 --> 00:19:42.205
Claire!

00:19:51.523 --> 00:19:53.491
Just this afternoon, this guy was...

00:19:53.625 --> 00:19:54.927
Don't say it.

00:19:54.927 --> 00:19:55.985
Huh?

00:19:56.295 --> 00:19:58.661
Because this is all we can do for the time being.

00:20:00.666 --> 00:20:02.429
'Cuz I don't want to die.

00:20:11.777 --> 00:20:15.380
Luke, did you go somewhere after the party?

00:20:15.380 --> 00:20:17.746
Or maybe you're already in bed.

00:20:18.984 --> 00:20:20.752
I'm sorry about tonight.

00:20:20.752 --> 00:20:23.346
We'll have to go check out that
museum when it's open, huh?

00:20:24.156 --> 00:20:27.523
I had a really good time today.
Well, goodnight.

00:20:33.966 --> 00:20:35.801
And so then you asked Emma out?

00:20:35.801 --> 00:20:37.564
Yes, that's right.

00:20:37.803 --> 00:20:42.207
And she said "yes" just like that.
It was such a relief!

00:20:42.207 --> 00:20:44.409
Well, as a rule, I'll never refuse anyone

00:20:44.409 --> 00:20:47.435
the first time they ask me out for dinner,
providing they're not too weird.

00:20:47.579 --> 00:20:49.604
You don't need to say it like that!

00:20:54.253 --> 00:20:58.656
Emilio! What are you doing here?
What a surprise!

00:21:00.425 --> 00:21:01.727
Is this an acquaintance of yours?

00:21:01.727 --> 00:21:03.058
Uh, yeah...

00:21:03.862 --> 00:21:05.030
It's been a while.

00:21:05.030 --> 00:21:06.498
Imagine running into you here.

00:21:06.498 --> 00:21:08.864
How many years has it been?
It's so good to see you!

00:21:09.034 --> 00:21:10.402
Good to see you too!

00:21:10.402 --> 00:21:12.962
Let me introduce you.
This is my friend Herve.

00:21:13.138 --> 00:21:14.605
It's a pleasure to meet you all.

00:21:15.107 --> 00:21:16.665
I apologize for disturbing you.

00:21:18.977 --> 00:21:21.241
Hello, good evening.

00:21:22.381 --> 00:21:23.905
Good evening.

00:21:28.420 --> 00:21:30.522
Rock, rock the LM. C!

00:21:30.522 --> 00:21:32.820
One, two, everybody go!

00:21:40.932 --> 00:21:43.201
The time has come! It's now! But still!

00:21:43.201 --> 00:21:45.804
It always starts with the tears in your eyes

00:21:45.804 --> 00:21:47.906
If every weighed-out day

00:21:47.906 --> 00:21:50.108
You leave feeling sick, fly high

00:21:50.108 --> 00:21:51.677
Yesterday's failures? They don't mean a thing!

00:21:51.677 --> 00:21:53.812
Tomorrow's worries? They don't mean a thing!

00:21:53.812 --> 00:21:55.947
What's always important is this moment

00:21:55.947 --> 00:21:58.541
So it goes up to the top, top, top, top

00:22:07.059 --> 00:22:08.794
Rock, rock the LM. C!

00:22:08.794 --> 00:22:10.195
Gather around, my comrades

00:22:10.195 --> 00:22:11.330
If the dream you haven't had doesn't fade away

00:22:11.330 --> 00:22:13.098
Rock, rock the LM. C!

00:22:13.098 --> 00:22:14.966
So don't care, babe!

00:22:14.966 --> 00:22:18.603
I'm not going to ask you the reason

00:22:18.603 --> 00:22:22.841
We'll protect you

00:22:22.841 --> 00:22:25.477
So it's okay even if they don't like you

00:22:25.477 --> 00:22:29.981
Even if they laugh at you

00:22:29.981 --> 00:22:33.018
Just keep going down that road you believe in

00:22:33.018 --> 00:22:35.620
Your tears are

00:22:35.620 --> 00:22:39.825
Two of this world's treasures beyond compare

00:22:39.825 --> 00:22:42.661
I will simply keep on singing

00:22:42.661 --> 00:22:49.801
So I won't lose it and it will reach you

00:22:49.801 --> 00:22:52.037
Rock, rock the LM. C!

00:22:52.037 --> 00:22:54.139
Rock, rock the LM. C!

00:22:54.139 --> 00:22:56.369
Rock, rock the LM. C!

00:23:01.780 --> 00:23:05.113
A kind smiling face and kind words...

00:23:06.151 --> 00:23:10.055
But hidden behind them, his thoughts...

00:23:10.055 --> 00:23:14.515
Episode #12
His Thoughts
